      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَا أُبَاوِلُهُ</span></b> , from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">البَالُ</span>, <i>I will not,</i> or <i>I do not,
cause him,</i> or <i>it, to move,</i> or <i>occur to, my mind.</i>
(Z, TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بلو</span>. See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَا أُبَالِيهِ</span> in that art.)

